Project Structure

src/
│
├── app/                        # App routes (already correct)
│   ├── page.tsx                # Home page
│   ├── login/
│   │   └── page.tsx            # Login page
│
├── components/                 # Reusable UI components
│   ├── TextArea.tsx
│   ├── Output.tsx
│   ├── AuthProvider.tsx
│   └── MarkdownRenderer.tsx
│
├── api/                         # Logic & API calls
│   ├── auth.ts                  # Auth-related functions (login, session, etc)
│   └── chat.ts                  # Chat-related API calls (create, send message, etc)
│
├── constants/                   # Shared constants
│   └── config.ts                # `apiBaseUrl`, endpoint paths
│
├── types/                       # TypeScript definitions
│   └── index.ts                 # (or Chat.ts, User.ts, etc)
│
├── styles/                      # Global or module CSS (optional)
│   └── globals.css